  accTitle: Terminal attempts have no outgoing transitions
  accDescr: Queued can start to Running or cancel to Cancelled. Running can complete to Succeeded, fail to Failed, or cancel to Cancelled. Succeeded, Failed and Cancelled have no outgoing permitted transitions. Guards and rejected outcomes are defined in the adjacent transition table.
